            │\n  │  │Dec│   │  │Dec│   │  Transformer Decoder    │\n  │  └─┬─┘   │  └─┬─┘   │                          │\n  │    │     │    │     │                          │\n  │  H_t     │  H_s     │                          │\n  │  [B,L,N,C] [B,L,N,C]│                          │\n  └────┬─────┴────┬─────┘                          │\n       │          │                                 │\n       └────┬─────┘                                 │\n            │                                       │\n       Concatenate [B, L, N, 2C]                    │\n            │                                       │\n            └──────────────┬────────────────────────┘\n                           │\n                    ┌──────┴──────┐\n                    │ GraphWaveNet│\n                    │  ┌───────┐  │\n                    │  │  GCN  │  │  Graph Convolution\n                    │  └───┬───┘  │\n                    │      │      │\n                    │  ┌───┴───┐  │\n                    │  │Dilated│  │  Dilated Causal Conv\n                    │  │ Conv  │  │  (4 blocks x 2 layers)\n                    │  └───┬───┘  │\n                    │      │      │\n                    │  ┌───┴───┐  │\n                    │  │ Skip  │  │  Skip Connections\n                    │  │Connect│  │\n                    │  └───┬───┘  │\n                    └──────┼──────┘\n                           │\n                    Output [B, T_out, N, 1]\n```\n\n### 13.2 Training Modes Flowchart\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│        STD-MAE Training Modes Decision Tree     │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n                    Start\n                      │\n        ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐\n        │                           │\n   End-to-End?               Pre-training?\n        │                           │\n        └──Yes──┐             ┌─────┴─────┐\n                │             │           │\n        ┌───────┴────────┐   T-MAE?    S-MAE?\n        │ Joint Training │    │           │\n        │ T-MAE + S-MAE  │   Yes         Yes\n        │ + GraphWaveNet │    │           │\n        │                │  ┌─┴──┐      ┌─┴──┐\n        │ Loss: MAE      │  │T-MAE│    │S-MAE│\n        │   (forecasting)│  │Only │    │Only │\n        └────────────────┘  └────┘      └────┘\n                              │           │\n                        Save T-MAE   Save S-MAE\n                              │           │\n                              └─────┬─────┘\n                                    │\n                            Load Pre-trained\n                                    │\n                            ┌───────┴────────┐\n                            │  Fine-tuning   │\n                            │ GraphWaveNet   │\n                            │ Loss: MAE      │\n                            │   (forecasting)│\n                            └────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 13.3 Configuration Template\n\n**File**: `custom_stdmae_config.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  "__comment__": "STD-MAE Custom Configuration Template",\n\n  "__architecture__": {\n    "patch_size": 12,\n    "embed_dim": 96,\n    "num_heads": 4,\n    "mlp_ratio": 4,\n    "dropout": 0.1,\n    "mask_ratio": 0.25,\n    "encoder_depth": 4,\n    "decoder_depth": 1\n  },\n\n  "__data__": {\n    "long_history_window": 864,\n    "input_window": 12,\n    "output_window": 12,\n    "scaler": "standard"\n  },\n\n  "__graphwavenet__": {\n    "gcn_bool": true,\n    "addaptadj": true,\n    "residual_channels": 32,\n    "dilation_channels": 32,\n    "skip_channels": 256,\n    "end_channels": 512,\n    "kernel_size": 2,\n    "blocks": 4,\n    "layers": 2\n  },\n\n  "__pretraining__": {\n    "pretrain_mode": false,\n    "pretrain_tmae": false,\n    "pretrain_smae": false,\n    "pre_trained_tmae_path": null,\n    "pre_trained_smae_path": null\n  },\n\n  "__training__": {\n    "max_epoch": 100,\n    "batch_size": 64,\n    "learner": "adam",\n    "learning_rate": 0.001,\n    "lr_decay": true,\n    "lr_scheduler": "multisteplr",\n    "lr_decay_ratio": 0.1,\n    "milestones": [1, 18, 36, 54, 72],\n    "clip_grad_norm": true,\n    "max_grad_norm": 3.0,\n    "use_early_stop": true,\n    "patience": 10\n  },\n\n  "__hardware__": {\n    "gpu": true,\n    "gpu_id": 0\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 13.4 Common Error Messages\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| `KeyError: \'X_long\'` | Long history not provided | Set `long_history_window` in dataset config |\n| `RuntimeError: out of memory` | Batch too large | Reduce `batch_size` or `embed_dim` |\n| `ValueError: mask_ratio must be in [0, 1]` | Invalid mask ratio | Set `mask_ratio` between 0 and 1 |\n| `AssertionError: patch_size must divide input_window` | Incompatible patch size | Use divisor of `long_history_window` |\n| `FileNotFoundError: pre_trained_tmae_path` | Pre-trained model missing | Check path or set to `null` |\n\n### 13.5 Performance Tuning Guide\n\n**For Speed**:\n1. Reduce `encoder_depth` from 4 to 2\n2. Reduce `embed_dim` from 96 to 64\n3. Reduce `long_history_window` from 864 to 432\n4. Increase `batch_size` to maximize GPU usage\n\n**For Accuracy**:\n1. Increase `encoder_depth` to 6\n2. Increase `embed_dim` to 128\n3. Increase `long_history_window` to 2016 (7 days)\n4. Use pre-training workflow\n5. Tune `learning_rate` carefully\n\n**For Memory**:\n1. Reduce `batch_size`\n2. Reduce `embed_dim`\n3. Reduce `skip_channels` and `end_channels`\n4. Enable gradient checkpointing (future work)\n\n---\n\n## Document Information\n\n**Title**: STD-MAE Migration Summary\n**Document Version**: 1.0\n**Last Updated**: January 22, 2026\n**Author**: AgentCity Migration Team\n**Status**: Final\n**File Path**: `/home/wangwenrui/private/shk/agentCity/documentation/std-mae__spatial-temporal_dual_masked_autoencoder_for_traffic_forecasting__n_a_migration_summary.md`\n\n**Changelog**:\n- **v1.0** (2026-01-22): Initial comprehensive migration summary\n\n---\n\n**End of Document**\n'